# Components

## Shared Components
- **ServiceCard**: id, name, description, price, imageUrl, duration, onAdd, **isSelected** (optional). When isSelected, show “Already selected” and disable add; green border/background.
- **ServiceModal**: service, isOpen, onClose, onAdd, **isSelected** (optional). When isSelected, show “Already selected” instead of “Add to Booking”.
- **CartBar**: itemCount, totalPrice, onContinue. Use `type="button"` on buttons.
- **CustomerForm**: onSubmit(data: { name, mobile, notes? }).
- **DateTimePicker**: onSelect(date, timeSlot), slotCounts, durationMinutes.
- **PaymentScreen**, **ConfirmationScreen**: receive booking/payment props; ConfirmationScreen can take locationName, locationAddress, locationMobile, locationImageUrl for invoice.
- **Navigation**: hides on `/booking/*`; shows Home, Book Appointment (/booking/location), Staff, Admin by role.

## Conventions
- Use Tailwind; avoid inline styles. Prefer min-h-[44px] for touch targets.
- Images: use placeholder until load (PLACEHOLDER_IMAGE from lib/placeholders) to avoid blank flash; handle onError fallback.
- Don’t mention “R2” or storage backend in user-facing text.
